include README.md LICENSE THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md CONTRIBUTING.md SECURITY.md CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md CHANGELOG.md run-vela run-vela.cmd
recursive-include packaging *.rules *.desktop
recursive-include docs *.md *.png
